      ],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>There is a lot of fragrance advice floating around out there, and a surprising amount of it is just wrong. Not nuanced-and-debatable wrong. Flat-out wrong. Things that got repeated often enough in Vogue magazine, Bloomingdale's and fragrance TikToks that they eventually started sounding like facts. </p><p>Here are six of the most stubborn ones, along with what is actually true.</p>"
      }
    },
    "177868816090d620d4": {
